## Title: Connoisseur & Restocker
## Notes: Macros that automatically use your best food, water, potions, healthstones, bandages, poisons, and pet food, plus a Restock List that auto-buys and banks your consumables and upgrades them as you level. Quality-of-life automation for peak performance.
## Author: Gogo1951

